sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as Claude / Agent
    participant MCP as HydraMCP<br/>(stdio, JSON-RPC 2.0)
    participant Vault as HydraVault<br/>VaultScanner
    participant Health as HydraHealth<br/>HealthChecker
    participant Obs as Obsidian vault

    Agent->>MCP: tools/list
    MCP-->>Agent: 8 declared tools

    Note over Agent,MCP: health_check and search are implemented today

    Agent->>MCP: tools/call health_check
    MCP->>Vault: scan()
    Vault->>Obs: read notes, tags, frontmatter
    Obs-->>Vault: inventory
    Vault-->>MCP: VaultInventory
    MCP->>Health: checkAll(inventory)
    Health-->>MCP: HealthReport
    MCP-->>Agent: status, summary, per-check results

    Agent->>MCP: tools/call search {query}
    MCP->>Vault: scan()
    Vault-->>MCP: VaultInventory
    MCP-->>Agent: matches by title / tag (max 20)

    Agent->>MCP: tools/call relationships
    MCP-->>Agent: not_yet_implemented
